<title>POLAND: Krakchemia plans no 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Krakchemia plans no 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish retailer Krakchemia SA on June 30 will vote on management's proposal to pay no 1996 dividend and put 915,448 zlotys of last year's 1.15 million zloty net profit into reserves, the firm said.</p>
<p>Krakchemia said in a statement on Monday that the remaining 0.1 million zlotys would go toward a social fund for employees.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
